{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114051822960697344"]}, "author_id": "1809212258574323712", "created_at": "2026-10-24T17:50:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114051829726076940"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/gwPWyp4nUF", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EmberAITech/status/2114051829726076940/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114051822960697344", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/gwPWyp4nUF"}]}, "id": "2114051829726076940", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "AI has officially outgrown the traditional energy grid.\n\nThe next critical bottleneck in artificial intelligence is not silicon supply or training data. It is megawatts. \n\nGigawatt-scale data centers required to train next-generation frontier models cannot be sustained by https://t.co/gwPWyp4nUF", "url": "https://x.com/EmberAITech/status/2114051829726076940"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113654638310203392"]}, "author_id": "2103141510799642624", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:31:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113654639857955257"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Every human predicts the future of AI. We keep the receipts.", "display_url": "aipredictionindex.com/predictions/?p…", "end": 203, "expanded_url": "https://www.aipredictionindex.com/predictions/?person=Elon%20Musk", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111887984542756864/9dGOX96O?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111887984542756864/9dGOX96O?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 180, "status": 200, "title": "AI Prediction Index", "unwound_url": "https://www.aipredictionindex.com/predictions/?person=Elon%20Musk", "url": "https://t.co/h06LF9OK7Y"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/PBp5eE9p2Y", "end": 227, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/aipredictionx/status/2113654639857955257/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113654638310203392", "start": 204, "url": "https://t.co/PBp5eE9p2Y"}]}, "id": "2113654639857955257", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🟡 \"First Gigawatt training cluster in the world.\"\nElon Musk, 2026\n\nEpoch's satellite read: ~350 MW in January, ~946 MW by September. The 1.5GW April upgrade now projected Q1 2027.\nhttps://t.co/h06LF9OK7Y https://t.co/PBp5eE9p2Y", "url": "https://x.com/aipredictionx/status/2113654639857955257"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113427084563320832"]}, "author_id": "494126672", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:27:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113427089713955012"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TMrkWPVHFK", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TSC/status/2113427089713955012/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113427084563320832", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/TMrkWPVHFK"}, {"display_url": "x.com/i/status/21133…", "end": 319, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/i/status/2113313944966177176", "start": 296, "url": "https://t.co/rPa0aLOklE"}]}, "id": "2113427089713955012", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113313944966177176", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "nvidia built a thing that watches every gpu, cable and job in a datacenter and points at the one part slowing the whole training run, so an event storm becomes one incident. the hot gpu sitting there degrading quietly while everything else looks fine is the whole problem https://t.co/TMrkWPVHFK https://t.co/rPa0aLOklE", "url": "https://x.com/TSC/status/2113427089713955012"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113578334680739840"]}, "author_id": "1977323274511302656", "created_at": "2026-10-23T10:28:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113578343929127254"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 2